      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "培育大量“能够赢得GⅠ竞赛的知名赛马娘”，\n这点也是能够支撑赛马娘界的贡献之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a4da852354a47f9cb6264d4208361128e5abcc7b338053a509a5403e80fac71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
