      "uid": "zhcn:d7c7c3ca0cdebedd0e804ce9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，小北她真的很了不起喔。\n她具备了我所没有的韧性……该说是超强意志力？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b549e138feae336256b570b63ddd475e558517a053b1dfb0c951be28fb0a973",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
