      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，是吧？\n虽然“皋月赏”和“日本德比”\n她都很可惜地跑输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1fb4d663c139b7b65ce7a485f302e6273e38a9ca4a7b026473190416fd9e69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
