    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f8215c0c218946a04437ac9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要战胜的目标──\n北部玄驹的存在促使里见光钻更加进步──\n听完这些话后，我更加深深相信是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "795318453349ff80d1742f192a97c9a1113ac2fdab39217331e73bccb4d3e9bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
